---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="About" description="JT Embry, owner of Embry Development, LLC in Louisville: a decade of fintech and healthtech engineering, now a one-person studio.">
  <section class="section band-dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>One engineer. No account managers.</h1>
      <p class="lede">When you email {site.legalName}, the person who answers is the person who does the work.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>I'm JT Embry. I've spent the last decade building fintech and healthtech products as an engineer and then as a lead: a greenfield SaaS product, a WebRTC portal for hospitals, a full platform migration to a new cloud, and most recently an AI tooling rollout that changed how a whole team ships.</p>
      <p>Before that I was the help-desk guy at a bank, cleaned LiDAR sensor data for a self-driving program, and studied English literature. The through-line is the same: find where the friction is, remove it, and leave people better equipped than I found them. I measure my work by how much of it keeps running after I've stepped away.</p>
      <p>{site.legalName} is the company I formed in 2026 to do that on my own terms: software and AI systems for teams and small practices, sites and automation for small businesses, and, since I put a 3D printer in the shop, the physical parts too.</p>
      <p>I live in Louisville. When I'm not building I'm restoring a Ducati Scrambler, training a dog, reading theology, and chasing the Embry family back through the census.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Get in touch</a> <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={site.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
